          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఆసుపత్రి (āsupatri) is usually traced to English hospital, reshaped. Neither DEDR nor CDIAL records it."
            }
          ]
        },
